  "bodyHash": "fbb15ead9218c2e3",
  "content": "\n\n<h1>Create：EMF 相容</h1>\n<p>這是一款輕量的用戶端模組，在使用 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a></strong> 的 <strong>天鉤 (Skyhook)</strong> 功能時，會暫停 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Model Features</a></strong> 的玩家動畫，包含來自 Aeronautics 的鏈條與繩索騎乘效果。</p>\n<p>已使用 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fa-player-extension\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations: Player Extension</a></strong> 與 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/detailed-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Detailed Animations</a></strong> 進行測試，但理論上應能與任何玩家動畫資源包相容。</p>\n<p><strong>亦新增了對「抓取物理物件」功能的相容支援！</strong></p>\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>騎乘天鉤時暫停 EMF 的玩家動畫</li>\n<li>適用於 Create 天鉤機制中的鏈條與繩索</li>\n<li>與 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fa-player-extension\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations: Player Extension</a></strong> 相容</li>\n<li>應能與大多數使用 EMF 的玩家動畫資源包相容</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>額外相容模組</h2>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-aeronautics\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Aeronautics</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-aeronautics-climbable-rope\" rel=\"nofollow\">可攀爬繩索 (Climbable Ropes)</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-grappling-hooks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Grappling Hooks</a></strong></p>\n<h2>影片介紹</h2>\n<span><span class=\"embed-removed\"> 嵌入內容已移除：<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https%3a%2f%2fwww.youtube-nocookie.com%2fembed%2f072A-CVufho\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/072A-CVufho</a> </span></span>\n<h2>影片介紹（Aeronautics 更新版）</h2>\n<span><span class=\"embed-removed\"> 嵌入內容已移除：<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https%3a%2f%2fwww.youtube-nocookie.com%2fembed%2fYHm2dS88qz8\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/YHm2dS88qz8</a> </span></span>\n<p>祝您遊玩愉快 <sup>_</sup></p>",
